### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 2. Register New User (Dispatches async user.created event to NATS)
# @name registerUser
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex.engineer@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword2026!",
  "name": "Alex Engineer"
}

### 3. Login User & Get JWT
# @name loginUser
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex.engineer@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword2026!"
}

### Store token from login response
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Get Current User Profile (Protected Route)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Update Profile (Dispatches async user.updated event to NATS)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Senior Engineer"
}

### 6. Forgot Password (Dispatches async user.password_reset event to NATS)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex.engineer@example.com"
}

### 7. Notification Service - View Audit Logs (Consumed from NATS)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/notifications/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Notification Service - System Delivery Metrics
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/notifications/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
